MegaMatrix Commission Engine - Technical Design Document
Section 1: Database Schema Design
1.1 Design Principles
Currency: All monetary amounts in GBP (£)

Precision: DECIMAL(10,2) for all financial amounts (supports up to £99,999,999.99)

Performance: Optimized for high read/write volume

Auditability: Complete transaction trail for compliance

Scalability: Designed for billions of rows

1.2 Core Tables
Table 1: visa_tiers - Visa Tier Master Data
sql
CREATE TABLE visa_tiers (
    -- Primary Identifier
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    
    -- Tier Information
    name VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    tier_order INTEGER UNIQUE NOT NULL, -- For sorting/upgrade path
    
    -- Financial Attributes (GBP)
    once_off_price_gbp DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (once_off_price_gbp >= 0),
    monthly_fee_gbp DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (monthly_fee_gbp >= 0),
    monthly_cap_gbp DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (monthly_cap_gbp >= 0),
    
    -- Business Rules
    is_free_tier BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    monthly_fee_trigger_percent DECIMAL(5,2) DEFAULT 110.00, -- 110% = fee × 1.10
    auto_upgrade_at_cap BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE, -- Free tier only
    
    -- Matrix Restrictions
    allowed_matrix_level INTEGER CHECK (
        allowed_matrix_level BETWEEN 1 AND 8 
        OR allowed_matrix_level IS NULL
    ),
    max_positions_available INTEGER, -- NULL = unlimited
    
    -- System Fields
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    
    -- Constraints
    CHECK (CASE 
        WHEN is_free_tier = TRUE THEN monthly_fee_gbp = 0 
        ELSE TRUE 
    END),
    CHECK (monthly_fee_trigger_percent BETWEEN 100 AND 200)
);

-- Indexes
